    campingClassification: 'nearby_basecamp', camping: 'No on-route camping is assumed. Use verified Coal River corridor campgrounds or lodging near John Slack/Alum Creek as a basecamp, and confirm current availability, fees, fire rules, and overnight parking separately.', logisticsSummary: 'Full Big Coal B-5 beginner reach from the Sproul pull-off to Alum Creek Lions Club Park, with Lock 4 as a shorter decision point and an upstream Ashford gauge proxy.',
